..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : PLAN.ME
.. Autor          : cl
.. Verantwortlich : tiwe
.. Kontrolle      : cl
.. Funktion       : Maskeneintritts-FOP
...Includes             :
.. include la/PLAN.INI
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. Icons
.formula M|rotz         = G|icokrit
.formula M|gelbz        = G|icovkrit
.formula M|gruenz       = G|icoukrit
.formula M|mindbestz    = "icon:arrow_blue_right"
.formula M|gesbestz     = "icon:arrow_blue_down"
.formula M|stoepsel     = "icon:deadend"
.formula M|planrelz     = "icon:bulb_on"
.formula M|notplanrelz  = "icon:bulb_off"
.formula M|iinbfrist    = "icon:ball_green"
.formula M|attdispo     = "icon:attention"
.formula M|reservz      = "icon:transfer_minus"
.formula M|beschaffz    = "icon:transfer_plus"
.formula M|bbesres      = "icon:screen_edit"
.formula M|zbesres      = "icon:screen_view"
.formula M|vstatus      = "icon:selection"
.formula M|nachfolgerz  = "icon:replace"
.formula M|abrmge       = "icon:view" 
..
.. Individual Parameters
.input    "la/PLAN.INI"
..
.. Maximale Bindungsfrist
.copy M|bindung = F|sysinfo(10)^bindung
..
.. Internal warehouse
.copy M|intlgruppe = F|sysinfo(10)^intlgruppe
.copy M|klgruppe   = M|intlgruppe
..
.. 1 = Standardansicht, 2 = Wochenansicht
.. wird in la/PLAN.INI vorbelegt
.formula M|layoutnum = 1 ? _M|bwoche
.formula M|layoutnum = 2 ?  M|bwoche
..
.continue
